<div class="xp o"><div class="xh" onclick="xpt(this)"><span class="xc">&#9654;</span><span class="xt">Author Diversity: 1.0x</span></div><div class="xb">First post by this author (k=0). Formula: (1-0.25)*0.5^0 + 0.25 = 1.0x. Second would be 0.625x, third 0.4375x, fourth+ 0.25x.</div></div>
<div class="xp o"><div class="xh" onclick="xpt(this)"><span class="xc">&#9654;</span><span class="xt">OON Discount: 0.75x</span></div><div class="xb">
