<div class="xp o"><div class="xh" onclick="xpt(this)"><span class="xc">&#9654;</span><span class="xt">Bidirectional Boost: N/A</span></div><div class="xb">If mutual follow + original post, reply weight jumps 5.0 -> 20.0 (+15). Not applicable here.</div></div>
<div class="xp"><div class="xh" onclick="xpt(this)"><span class="xc">&#9654;</span><span class="xt">Cold Start: N/A</span></div><div class="xb">1,892 views > 1,000 threshold. No boost.</div></div>
</div></div>`},

{num:'STEP 8',title:'VMRanker DPP',sub:'Top 150 reranked for diversity using Determinantal Point Process.',
body:()=>`<div class="pj-2col"><div class="pj-card-col">${pc(bg('Pre-DPP #23','b')+bg('Post-DPP #19','g')+bg('Promoted +4','g'))}</div><div class="pj-main">
<div class="sr"><div class="st"><div class="sv">0.65</div><div class="sl">DPP theta</div></div><div class="st"><div class="sv">150</div><div class="sl">Pool</div></div><div class="st"><div class="sv">#23&#8594;#19</div><div class="sl">Rank change</div></div></div>
<div class="fm">1. Pool = top 150 by score\n2. Quality: qf[i] = exp(0.929 * q[i])\n3. Kernel: L[i,j] = qf[i]*qf[j]*cos(emb_i, emb_j)\n4. Greedy Cholesky: max conditional variance\n5. SID prefix 142 (nature) underrepresented -> promoted</div>
<div class="co"><strong>Diversity wins.</strong> Top posts were heavy on tech/news. Sunset photo brings thematic variety. Avg cosine: 0.34 before, 0.19 after.</div>
</div></div>`},

